# Phase 5 input cluster, I11: one question past fx v0.0.16's cap, then none.
# Both are refused before any panel opens, with
# `(ask_user_question: provide 1 to 20 questions)` (28cf53b5), and each turn
# goes on to its answer.
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
gateway p5-input-question21-turns.json
wait 4
type ask too many
key Enter
wait 3
snap q21
type ask none
key Enter
wait 3
snap q0
snapfull q0
gwlog
